46=+ Fixed %post & %postun scripts for `setcap`
47=+ Self-contained `RPM` and `DEB` packages
48=
49=**Note:** Packages installation scripts have been corrected. If, after updating, pressing 'Restart' doesn't launch, run the following command as root: `setcap 'cap_net_bind_service=+ep' /opt/dnscrypt-gui/dnscrypt-proxy`
50=
51=v1.1
52=+ The `dnscrypt-proxy` package is no longer required
53=+ Fully autonomous `RPM` and `DEB` packages (self-contained)
54=+ Own systemd service - `/etc/systemd/user/dnscrypt-proxy.service`
55=+ The latest `dnscrypt-proxy` (v2.1.14) build from the developer's github is already inside
56=
57=**Note:** For a clean install and use, you need to remove `dnscrypt-proxy` if it was installed from the repository.
58=
